This is a '''list of quotes by {{ai|Sage}}'''. Sage is voiced by Naomi Yang in English. Necessary quotes are translated from Chinese to English. Sage has a total of {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Sage Quotes}} files of quotes including unused and removed lines, and excluding [[#The Range's lore assets|The Range's lore assets]].

A downloadable folder containing all the audio files on this page can be found [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12tkF_ND5riJ6aBRUQQDr_4-iS0m5axsC?usp=sharing here].
